# November 20, 2026: the Silver Valley of northern Idaho (Shoshone County, with the Cataldo Mission just over the line in
# Kootenai County) and the Milwaukee Road country up the St. Joe River at Avery. Region drawn at random by tools/choose.py (id).
# Sources read in this session: National Register nomination forms (NPGallery "_text" PDFs, read with tools/page.py),
# Wikipedia articles (tools/wiki_raw.py), the Northern Pacific Depot Foundation's pages, Idaho Parks and Recreation's Old
# Mission page, the Forest Service's Pulaski Tunnel Trail page, the Sierra Silver Mine Tour's pages, the Route of the
# Hiawatha's own page, the Idaho Heritage Trust's Wallace library page, Spokane Historical and HistoryNet on Burke.
# No interior was seen by any source opened unless the entry says so.
